OL,3,AApple ordered to pay $5.7bn after
OL,4,Alosing vibration tech patent suit
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple has been ordered to pay $5.7bn
OL,7,F(#4.3bn) in damages after a US jury
OL,8,Ffound it had used another firm's tech
OL,9,Fwithout permission.
OL,11,FAudio firm Taction Technology claimed
OL,12,Fin 2021 that Apple had infringed two of
OL,13,Fits patents for haptics systems, which
OL,14,Fenable vibrations for actions such as
OL,15,Freceiving a message or pressing a
OL,16,Fbutton.
OL,18,FThis tech is built into devices like
OL,19,Fthe iPhone and Apple Watch.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
