OL,3,ACeline Dion kicks off Paris Fashion
OL,4,AWeek with surprise performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FDion recently performed a comeback show
OL,7,Fin the city earlier this month, her
OL,8,Ffirst since her 2020 concert in New
OL,9,FJersey - the last before the Covid
OL,10,Fpandemic cut her tour short.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
